#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:5
#: 8d930f0e9da048acbf334987c1b07a1c
msgid ""
"FreeSWITCH is a modular softswitch: a software-defined telecom stack that"
" replaces proprietary PBX and class-5 switching hardware with a process "
"that runs on commodity servers, from a Raspberry Pi to a multi-core host."
" This repository is the C core, loadable modules, XML configuration "
"profiles, packaging, and Event Socket tooling for that stack. Version in "
"this tree is **1.11.3-dev** (`configure.ac`). License is **MPL 1.1**. "
"SignalWire is the primary sponsor; `mod_signalwire` in this tree pairs a "
"local switch with SignalWire cloud services."
msgstr ""
"FreeSWITCH 是一套模块化软交换：用运行在通用服务器上的进程（从 Raspberry Pi 到多核主机）替代专有 PBX 和 "
"class-5 交换硬件的软件定义电信栈。本仓库是该栈的 C 核心、可加载模块、XML 配置模板、打包以及 Event Socket "
"工具。本树版本为 **1.11.3-dev**（`configure.ac`）。许可证为 **MPL 1.1**。SignalWire "
"是主要赞助方；本树中的 `mod_signalwire` 将本地交换机与 SignalWire 云服务对接。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:7
#: 72ba1d21b658465fa4a171237ff17982
msgid "Purpose"
msgstr "目的"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:9
#: 195ed77cc56f4f09825228a39ad92695
msgid ""
"Switch, bridge, and transcode real-time voice, video, and messaging "
"sessions."
msgstr "交换、桥接并转码实时语音、视频和消息会话。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:10
#: f01228e49594484da30080e79995e840
msgid ""
"Expose a loadable-module API so SIP, WebRTC, codecs, dialplans, "
"languages, and CDR backends can be added without forking the core."
msgstr "提供可加载模块 API，以便在无需 fork 核心的情况下增加 SIP、WebRTC、编解码器、拨号计划、语言和 CDR 后端。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:11
#: 8f6f1a314e234081b475b22bb93d345f
msgid ""
"Provide a working default PBX configuration (`conf/vanilla`) so operators"
" can start testing immediately."
msgstr "提供可用的默认 PBX 配置（`conf/vanilla`），方便运维人员立即开始测试。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:12
#: dd896e96c6f44b5f920274727ef32cec
msgid ""
"Offer an out-of-process control plane (Event Socket / ESL) so "
"applications can originate, hang up, and subscribe to events without "
"embedding in the media process."
msgstr "提供进程外控制面（Event Socket / ESL），使应用可以发起呼叫、挂断并订阅事件，而无需嵌入媒体进程。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:14
#: 33de872363134fdcb42533abac9ba2e8
msgid ""
"This PKB documents **this source tree**. Operator configuration — XML, "
"directory, SIP profiles, dialplan, codecs, applications, WebRTC, ESL — "
"lives in the [FreeSWITCH Users "
"Manual](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/). Every parameter "
"table there is verified against FreeSWITCH source and the shipped vanilla"
" config. Older wiki pages remain on [FreeSWITCH "
"Explained](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/FreeSWITCH-"
"Explained/) and [Confluence](https://freeswitch.org/confluence/)."
msgstr ""
"本 PKB 记录的是**本源码树**。运维配置（XML、号码簿、SIP profiles、拨号计划、编解码、应用、WebRTC、ESL）在 "
"[FreeSWITCH "
"用户手册](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/)。手册中的参数表均对照 FreeSWITCH"
" 源码与随附 vanilla 配置核实。旧 wiki 仍在 [FreeSWITCH "
"Explained](https://developer.signalwire.com/freeswitch/FreeSWITCH-"
"Explained/) 与 [Confluence](https://freeswitch.org/confluence/)。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:16
#: c0082e7eaf004378925e75a61eae91f3
msgid ""
"The Users Manual applies to both **Open Source FreeSWITCH** (this tree "
"and [release builds](https://files.freeswitch.org/releases/freeswitch/)) "
"and **FreeSWITCH Enterprise** (commercially supported SignalWire builds)."
" Hosted SignalWire cloud is still a separate product."
msgstr ""
"用户手册同时适用于 **开源 "
"FreeSWITCH**（本仓库与[发行构建](https://files.freeswitch.org/releases/freeswitch/)）和"
" **FreeSWITCH Enterprise**（SignalWire 商业支持构建）。托管的 SignalWire 云仍是独立产品。"

