#: a807582aef0549709e09312a78fc5f14
msgid ""
"**PBX / CCaaS operator**: run vanilla or a custom XML profile as an IP-"
"PBX, conference, voicemail, or call-center node; register SIP phones; "
"route DIDs."
msgstr ""
"**PBX / CCaaS 运维人员**：以 vanilla 或自定义 XML 配置运行 IP-PBX、会议、语音信箱或呼叫中心节点；注册 SIP"
" 话机；路由 DID。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:31
#: 462917e26507455e98b1466ca420ef03
msgid ""
"**SBC / interconnect engineer**: use the `conf/sbc` profile and Sofia SIP"
" (`mod_sofia`) to border-control SIP trunks and media."
msgstr "**SBC / 互联工程师**：使用 `conf/sbc` 配置和 Sofia SIP（`mod_sofia`）对 SIP 中继和媒体做边界控制。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:32
#: dc6e5ad998cd4661b606097a54227dd1
msgid ""
