"modules or from an external process over ESL (`mod_event_socket` on TCP "
"8021, `libs/esl/fs_cli.c`)."
msgstr ""
"**应用开发者**：通过 Lua/Python/JavaScript 模块，或经 ESL 从外部进程控制呼叫（`mod_event_socket`"
" 监听 TCP 8021，`libs/esl/fs_cli.c`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:33
#: 50da3c9219ce4b44a15681c22034682a
msgid ""
