"(`mod_verto`, endpoint name `verto.rtc`)."
msgstr "**WebRTC / HTML5 开发者**：通过 Verto（`mod_verto`，终端名 `verto.rtc`）终结浏览器会话。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:34
#: 41f6333215a0485b9eca28d1f459f5c3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Module developer**: implement `SWITCH_MODULE_LOAD_FUNCTION` against "
"`src/include/switch.h`, register named interface tables, and drop a `.so`"
" into the modules directory "
"([Architecture](../1.architecture/01-architecture.md#loadable-module-"
"contract))."
msgstr ""
"**模块开发者**：对照 `src/include/switch.h` 实现 `SWITCH_MODULE_LOAD_FUNCTION`，并将 "
"`.so` 放入模块目录。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:35
#: cd2d9125baf04579868ec98de2cd1a28
