#: a4441b73f614418f87bb547d0fbc6198
msgid ""
"The shipped vanilla server configuration listens on wildcard IPv6 `::` "
"with the inbound ACL commented out. Whether that also accepts IPv4 "
"depends on the host's dual-stack socket behavior. The module sample "
"instead binds `127.0.0.1`. Change the ESL password, bind, and ACL before "
"exposing the vanilla configuration beyond a trusted management network."
msgstr ""
"随附的 vanilla 服务端配置监听通配 IPv6 地址 `::`，且入站 ACL 被注释掉。它是否同时接受 IPv4 "
"取决于主机双栈套接字行为。模块示例则绑定 `127.0.0.1`。在将 vanilla 配置暴露到可信管理网络之外之前，请修改 ESL "
"密码、绑定地址并启用 ACL。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:198
#: 416e2b3c18064e88b3a969644ed90bd5
msgid "System Snapshot"
msgstr "系统快照"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:200
#: 78087d15ced84824a3c67a6422b147a7
msgid ""
"**Deployment model**: single long-running `freeswitch` process per host "
"(Unix daemon or Windows service `FreeSWITCH`), plus optional sidecar apps"
" talking ESL. Not a microservice mesh. Default install prefix is "
"`/usr/local/freeswitch` (`configure.ac`)."
msgstr ""
"**部署模型**：每台主机一个长期运行的 `freeswitch` 进程（Unix 守护进程或 Windows 服务 "
"`FreeSWITCH`），外加可选的通过 ESL 通信的 sidecar 应用。不是微服务网格。默认安装前缀为 "
"`/usr/local/freeswitch`（`configure.ac`）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:201
#: 776dd484a86d4aeea04171099f052eaf
msgid ""
"**Core runtime shape**: threaded C core owns sessions, media, timers, and"
" a state machine; features load as DSOs from `src/mod/` categories "
"(`endpoints`, `applications`, `codecs`, `dialplans`, `event_handlers`, "
"`languages`, `xml_int`, …)."
msgstr ""
"**核心运行形态**：多线程 C 核心拥有会话、媒体、定时器和状态机；功能以 DSO 形式从 `src/mod/` "
"各类目录加载（`endpoints`、`applications`、`codecs`、`dialplans`、`event_handlers`、`languages`、`xml_int`"
" 等）。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:202
#: 2d2a1cb07c8e49329c3f804d69b8789f
msgid ""
"**Primary data path**: signaling (SIP/Verto/Skinny/…) → session "
"(`src/switch_core_session.c`) → XML dialplan / directory → applications "
"(bridge, conference, voicemail, …) → RTP/SRTP media (`src/switch_rtp.c`, "
"`src/switch_core_media.c`) → CDR/event consumers."
msgstr ""
"**主数据路径**：信令（SIP/Verto/Skinny/…）→ 会话（`src/switch_core_session.c`）→ XML "
"拨号计划 / directory → 应用（bridge、conference、voicemail 等）→ RTP/SRTP "
"媒体（`src/switch_rtp.c`、`src/switch_core_media.c`）→ CDR/事件消费者。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:203
#: 0f016bb6d97d4c2eb36a19b6ce2e1656
msgid ""
"**Top risk or constraint**: real-time media and large UDP port ranges. "
"Docker docs require host networking; vanilla ESL listens on wildcard "
"`::`:8021 with password `ClueCon` (`event_socket.conf.xml`) — change "
"bind/password and enable an ACL before any non-loopback exposure. "
"`fs_cli` still defaults to `127.0.0.1:8021`."
msgstr ""
"**主要风险或约束**：实时媒体和较大的 UDP 端口范围。Docker 文档要求使用 host 网络；vanilla ESL 在通配 "
"`::`:8021 上监听，密码为 `ClueCon`（`event_socket.conf.xml`）——在任何非 loopback "
"暴露之前修改绑定地址和密码并启用 ACL。`fs_cli` 仍默认连接 `127.0.0.1:8021`。"

#: ../../../Users/walterfan/workspace/walter/freeswitch_primer/man/0.getting-started/01-overview.md:226
#: cc4203ac7d124f75b3c166e4a86b69af
